 agent/tool_executor.py     | 216 ++----------------------------------
 agent/tool_worker_gates.py | 220 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 232 insertions(+), 204 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 agent/tool_worker_gates.py

